// Generated by scripts/book-pack/import.mjs from the private book pack, then finished by hand.
// Section love_friendship: structure labels are the book's short names; every other word is the
// pack's own-words coaching or ours. No quotation from the book. The Cooperative Principle carries
// White Lies (who a kind untruth really serves); Schulz von Thun's model carries Watzlawick's
// axioms (silence says something too, and a repeating exchange is kept turning by both sides).
// Game Theory keeps the book's shared-gift agreement: it has no prison sentences or payoffs, so it
// is not Decision Maker's prisoner's dilemma. Second-Order Observation is a variant of Problem
// Solver's perspective shift: it watches how each person is looking, and the blind spot neither
// can see, instead of listing stakeholders.
